{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Driving Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Driving Life</i>, a hardcore driving and survival experience set in the heart of rural America. Stranded on a remote island with barely any money, you\u2019ll have to scrape by, taking on driving jobs, managing expenses, and surviving on whatever cheap food and drinks you can afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/gif2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744388494\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a <strong>realistic driving model</strong>, manual transmissions, and a variety of vehicles to operate, <i>Driving Life</i> is a true test of skill and endurance. From small personal cars to minivans and even heavy-duty trucks, every vehicle demands mastery as you navigate the island\u2019s winding roads, dirt trails, and ferry routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/gif1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744388494\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Realistic Driving Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Manual transmission, clutch control, and varied vehicle handling.<br>\ud83d\ude90 <strong>Diverse Vehicles</strong> \u2013 Drive everything from compact cars to massive trucks.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Hardcore Economy</strong> \u2013 Earn just enough to survive\u2026 if you play it smart.<br>\ud83c\udfe8 <strong>Island Life</strong> \u2013 Stay in a rundown motel, pay rent weekly, and work odd jobs.<br>\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your car fueled, your stomach full, and your debts paid.<br>\ud83d\udea2 <strong>Ferry Routes</strong> \u2013 Transport tourists and goods between terminals to earn cash.<br>\ud83e\udd6b <strong>Survival on a Budget</strong> \u2013 Eat cheap meals, drink what you can afford, and don\u2019t blow your last dollar on a flashy car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure begins in a modest motel, where the owner might call you for work\u2014driving a van to pick up tourists from the ferry. You\u2019ll start with a clunky manual car, but if you manage your money wisely, you might just afford an upgrade. Be warned: every decision matters. Miss a rent payment? Run out of gas? Go broke? You\u2019re in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you have what it takes to survive behind the wheel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/gif3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744388494\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531470?t=1744388494","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/5fb7dc9b7917fa3f35445fb53687a3f00a26f7b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744388494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/da7c7dd3da2c3fcdfdf723436d89e0e2c22dae1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744388494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/da7c7dd3da2c3fcdfdf723436d89e0e2c22dae1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744388494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3533490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Driving Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Driving Life</i>, a hardcore driving and survival experience set in the heart of rural America. Stranded on a remote island with barely any money, you\u2019ll have to scrape by, taking on driving jobs, managing expens